shu-041","source_id":"s-zhoushu041-ws2432538","chapter_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538","paragraph_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p013","quote":"與弟分袂西陝，言反東區，雖保周陵，還依蔣徑，三姜離㭊，二仲不歸。糜鹿為曹，更多悲緒。丹經在握，貧病莫諧；芝术可求，恆為採掇。昔吾壯日，及弟富年，俱值邕熙，竝歡衡泌。南風雅操，清商妙曲，絃琴促坐，無乏名晨。玉瀝金華，冀獲難老。不虞一旦，翻覆波瀾。吾已愒陰，弟非茂齒。禽、尚之契，各在天涯，永念生平，難為胷臆。且當視陰數箭，排愁破涕。人生樂耳，憂戚何為。豈能遽悲次房，遊魂不反。遠〔傷金〕（產）〔彥〕，骸柩無託。但願愛玉體，珍金箱，保期頤，享黃髮。猶冀蒼（膺）〔雁〕頳鯉，時傳尺素，清風朗月，俱寄相思。子淵，子淵，長為別矣！握管操觚，聲淚俱咽。","person_mention_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p013:m0249","object_person_mention_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p013:m0249"},{"work_id":"w-zhoushu","book_id":"b-zhoushu-041","source_id":"s-zhoushu041-ws2432538","chapter_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538","paragraph_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p014","quote":"尋出為（宣）〔宜〕州刺史。卒於位，時年六十四。子鼒嗣。","person_mention_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p014:m0024","subject_person_mention_id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p014:m0024"}],"interpretation_note":"完整王襃傳末子鼒明子父稱，父親依全傳主語及書信後回敘；不是僅由嗣推父，不推絕對排行、母親、承爵名或年份。與新唐書生鼒原斷言分源並存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"source_assertion_id":"a-xintang072-wyd-zi_sui-father","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface","source_id":"s-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface","paragraph_id":"c-xintangshu-072zhong-wyd1739-wang-preface:p003","quote":"昌安侯生規字威明左戶尚書南昌章侯生褒褒字子淵後周光祿大夫石泉康侯生鼒字玉鉉隋安都通守石泉明威侯子弘讓弘直","source_term":"鼒"}],"interpretation_note":"早出梁書/周書完整近系互證後配置；分支字元非排行，不採遠祖譜。","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAA"}],"name_components":[{"id":"name-xintang072-wyd-zi_sui","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAA","surname":"王","ming":"鼒","zi":"玉鉉","hao":null,"title":null,"additio